    {
      "id": "a1-u01-l03-e12",
      "type": "mcq",
      "question": "Someone says *Memnun oldum*. You answer *Ben de memnun oldum*. What does *ben de* add?",
      "options": ["too", "not", "very"],
      "optionsLang": "en",
      "answer": 0,
      "explain": "*Ben de* means me too, so *Ben de memnun oldum* is nice to meet you too. Often *Ben de* on its own is enough."
